// Jacob, addressed to professionals. Portrait: Jacob seated at the mic,
// notebook in hand, facilitating (svh-retreat-facilitator-jacob-seated).
---

<section class="we-about">
  <div class="we-about-inner">
    <div class="we-about-head">
      <div class="we-eyebrow" style="justify-content: center;">Who teaches it</div>
      <h2 class="we-h2 we-about-h2">
        Jacob Vermeulen — <em>the one holding the room.</em>
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="we-about-grid">
      <div class="we-about-portrait-wrap">
        <img
          class="we-about-portrait"
          src="/media/library/svh-retreat-facilitator-jacob-seated.webp"
          alt="Jacob Vermeulen facilitating a Somatic Vocal Healing circle"
          loading="lazy"
        />
      </div>

      <div class="we-about-text">
        <p class="we-about-lead">
          I can't teach you this from a presentation. I can let you feel it — and then
          show you how I hold it.
        </p>
        <p class="we-about-lead we-about-lead--body">
          I'm a pianist and singer, and the creator of Somatic Vocal Healing.
          Fifteen-plus years and a few thousand students later, it's become a
          coherent, teachable method — somatic, trauma-informed, and built on
          one conviction: the participant heals themselves, and we hold the
          space for that. In these 100 minutes I'll work the way I always work,
          and name what I'm doing while I do it — the questions, the
          listening, the staying out of the way.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
